  bio: "Bulut gibi, usul usul. En yumu\u015Fak mindere k\u0131vr\u0131l\u0131p m\u0131r\u0131ldan\u0131r."
  encounterDialogue: "Park\u0131n bank\u0131n\u0131n alt\u0131nda titreyen bir yumak
    buldun. Pamuk, burnunu parma\u011F\u0131na de\u011Fdirip 'beni de g\xF6t\xFCr\xFCr
    m\xFCs\xFCn?' diye bak\u0131yor. Evde ona bir g\xFCne\u015F dilimi ay\u0131raca\u011F\u0131z."
